      "status": "accepted",
      "design_delta_summary": "1) Replace the parent split between `unknown-opaque` and `unknown-hard-reject` with `unknown-quarantine`: unknown payload or signature profile pCIDs may be stored and forwarded as exact bytes but never accepted semantically. 2) Add explicit `sig_pcid` dispatch, changing the envelope from `[pcid,payload,signature]` to `[pcid,payload,sig_pcid,signature]` so verification rules are named rather than implied. 3) Normalize processing outcomes into accepted, quarantined, and rejected classes to improve auditability under mixed-version deployments.",
